diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..1087c7c 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,41 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers the push subscription the browser got from the push service, so that whatever lands in the person's tray also reaches their phone and desktop. Only the current user can register their own subscriptions.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | The push service endpoint to deliver to |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | The user's public ECDH key |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | The user's authentication secret |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/a-device",
+    "p256dh_key": "BD45oy_sYrIjVe1Em6MJGTMvMQvWj6ssgdNR2BoXN_bb85DKVqGCo4nkD_SeDkYYRCHU-o6D4E-HGJh7ohA94-k=",
+    "auth_key": "-wbxty3_2-EAT67HbE2Gog=="
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscription`
+
+Forgets the subscription for the device that unsubscribed, so it no longer receives pushes.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | The push service endpoint to forget |
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
